# =====================================================================
#  NexOS standalone application manifest -- SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#  The 64-bit kernel parses this file from the SFS volume at boot.  There
#  is NO compiled-in application list any more: the desktop, Start menu,
#  taskbar and the native launcher all ask the kernel for this table.
#
#  Format (one app per line, '|' separated, no escaping):
#      kind | display name | mex file | icon colour (RGB hex) | letter | description
#
#  Rules:
#    * "kind" is the stable numeric id used by .lnk shortcuts and AppType
#      mapping.  Never renumber an existing kind.
#    * "mex file" must exist in sfs_files/ and be <= 19 characters.
#    * Lines starting with '#' or blank lines are ignored.
#    * UTF-8 is allowed in names/descriptions; keep them short.
# =====================================================================
